Presety PER Coding Style, PSR-12, Nette a Symfony
*************************************************

.[perex]
Co přesně zapíná každý vestavěný preset: pravidla i s volbami, které nastavuje jinak než výchozí, styl odsazení, konců řádků a délky řádku a presety, ze kterých vychází. Pravidlo bez uvedených voleb běží s výchozími hodnotami ze své stránky.

Preset se skládá z rodičů a vlastních položek: rodiče se použijí nejdřív a položka uvedená znovu se s nimi slévá po klíčích, takže potomek mění jen volby, které sám jmenuje. Vaše konfigurace je pak další taková vrstva, viz [Konfigurace |configuration#Presety a vrstvy]. Standardy `perCs`, `psr12`, `nette` a `symfony` rozhodují o celém stylu kódu a projekt si jeden z nich vezme za základ. Seznam pravidel u presetu je to, co pod ním běží: vlastní položky, co přinesli rodiče, i pravidla [skupin |configuration#Skupiny pravidel], které preset zapíná.


`perCs`
=======

PER Coding Style 3.1, vychází z `psr12`, odsazení 4 mezerami, konec řádku podle souboru. Pravidel celkem: 56.

- `attributeAfterPhpdoc`
- `attributePosition`
- `attributeSpacing`
- [binaryOperatorSpacing |rules/binaryOperatorSpacing]
- [blankLines |rules/blankLines] `betweenDeclarations: keep, betweenMethods: keep, betweenInterfaceMethods: keep, betweenMembers: keep, beforeDocumentedMember: keep, afterPhpdoc: keep, afterBlockOpeningBrace: keep, before: []`
- [bracesPosition |rules/bracesPosition] `singlelineAnonymousFunction: always, emptyBody: sameLine`
- `castCanonicalType`
- `castSpacing`
- `classDefinitionSpacing` `beforeParenthesis: none`
- `commaSpacing` `alignment: none`
- `concatSpacing`
- `constructSpacing` `allowMultilineExpression: true`
- `controlStructureBraces`
- `declareSpacing`
- `elseifKeyword`
- `eofLineEnding`
- `fallThroughComment`
- `fullOpeningTag`
- `functionNameSpacing`
- `heredocIndentation`
- `indentation`
- `keywordCasing`
- `lineEnding`
- `multilineArray`
- `multilineCall`
- `multilineChain`
- `multilineCondition`
- `multilineSignature` `promotedProperty: keep`
- `multilineTernary`
- `nameCasing` `class: PascalCase, method: camelCase, constant: UPPER_CASE, enumCase: PascalCase`
- `namedArgumentSpacing`
- `newArgumentParentheses` `anonymousClass: forbidden, namedClass: required`
- `noBom`
- `noClosingTag`
- `noTrailingWhitespace`
- `nowdocWithoutInterpolation`
- `orderedImports` `order: byKind`
- `orderedMembers` `order: [traitUse]`
- `parenthesesSpacing`
- `referenceSpacing`
- `semicolonSpacing` `after: keep, allowOwnLine: true`
- `shortArraySyntax`
- `singleMemberPerDeclaration` `members: [property, trait]`
- `singleMemberPerLine`
- `singleStatementPerLine`
- `spreadOperatorSpacing`
- `switchCaseColon`
- `switchCaseSpacing`
- `ternaryOperatorSpacing`
- [trailingComma |rules/trailingComma] `array: required, argument: required, parameter: required, matchArm: required, closureUse: required`
- `trueFalseNullCasing`
- `typeHintSpacing` `catch: none`
- `unaryOperatorSpacing`
- `uselessAttributeParentheses`
- `uselessImportBackslash`
- `visibilityRequired`


`psr12`
=======

PSR-12 Extended Coding Style, odsazení 4 mezerami, konec řádku podle souboru, řádky nejvýše 120 znaků. Pravidel celkem: 42.

- [binaryOperatorSpacing |rules/binaryOperatorSpacing]
- [blankLines |rules/blankLines] `betweenDeclarations: keep, betweenMethods: keep, betweenInterfaceMethods: keep, betweenMembers: keep, beforeDocumentedMember: keep, afterPhpdoc: keep, afterBlockOpeningBrace: keep, before: []`
- [bracesPosition |rules/bracesPosition] `singlelineAnonymousFunction: always`
- `castCanonicalType`
- `castSpacing`
- `classDefinitionSpacing`
- `commaSpacing` `alignment: none`
- `constructSpacing` `allowMultilineExpression: true`
- `controlStructureBraces`
- `declareSpacing`
- `elseifKeyword`
- `eofLineEnding`
- `fallThroughComment`
- `fullOpeningTag`
- `functionNameSpacing`
- `indentation`
- `keywordCasing`
- `lineEnding`
- `multilineCall`
- `multilineCondition`
- `multilineSignature` `promotedProperty: keep`
- `nameCasing` `class: PascalCase, method: camelCase, constant: UPPER_CASE`
- `newArgumentParentheses` `anonymousClass: keep`
- `noBom`
- `noClosingTag`
- `noTrailingWhitespace`
- `orderedImports` `order: byKind`
- `orderedMembers` `order: [traitUse]`
- `parenthesesSpacing`
- `referenceSpacing`
- `shortArraySyntax`
- `singleMemberPerDeclaration` `members: [property, trait]`
- `singleStatementPerLine`
- `spreadOperatorSpacing`
- `switchCaseColon`
- `switchCaseSpacing`
- `ternaryOperatorSpacing`
- `trueFalseNullCasing`
- `typeHintSpacing` `catch: single`
- `unaryOperatorSpacing`
- `uselessImportBackslash`
- `visibilityRequired`


`nette`
=======

Nette Coding Standard: PER Coding Style s tabulátory a rozvržením knihoven Nette, `declare(strict_types=1)` na řádku `<?php` a pravidla, podle kterých knihovny Nette píšou kód (jména, pořadí členů, zakázané funkce a anotace), vychází z `perCs`, zapíná skupiny `cleanup`, `types`, `correctness`, odsazení tabulátorem, konec řádku podle souboru, řádky nejvýše 140 znaků. Pravidel celkem: 156.

- `annotationCasing`
- `arraySpacing`
- `arrowFunction`
- `attributeAfterPhpdoc`
- `attributePosition`
- `attributeSpacing`
- [binaryOperatorSpacing |rules/binaryOperatorSpacing] `operatorPosition: start`
- [blankLines |rules/blankLines] `betweenDeclarations: [1, 2], betweenMethods: 2, betweenInterfaceMethods: 1, betweenMembers: [0, 1], beforeDocumentedMember: 1, afterPhpdoc: 0, afterBlockOpeningBrace: 0, before: [], beforeNamespace: 1, afterOpeningTag: keep, afterNamespace: 1, afterImports: 1, betweenImportGroups: 0, beforeDeclaration: 2, betweenBranches: lastSetApart, betweenCases: lastSetApart`
- [bracesPosition |rules/bracesPosition] `singlelineAnonymousFunction: keep, emptyBody: ownLine, multilineParameters: nextLineAfterReturnType`
- `castCanonicalType`
- `castSpacing`
- `classDefinitionSpacing` `beforeParenthesis: single`
- `classNameReferenceForString`
- `combinedAssignmentForRepeatedTarget`
- `combinedIssets`
- `combinedUnsets`
- `commaSpacing` `alignment: tabs`
- `commentSpacing`
- `complexStringVariable`
- `concatSpacing` `operatorPosition: start`
- `constructSpacing` `allowMultilineExpression: false`
- `controlStructureBraces`
- `declareSpacing`
- `doubleColonSpacing`
- `elseifKeyword`
- `eofLineEnding`
- `explicitAssertion`
- `explicitOperatorPrecedence`
- `fallThroughComment` `comment: break omitted`
- `forbiddenAnnotations` `annotations: [@access, @author, @copyright, @created, @license, @package, @since, @subpackage, @todo, @version]`
- `forbiddenPhpdocLines` `patterns: [~^(?:(?!private|protected|static)\S+ )?(?:con|de)structor\.\z~i, ~^Created by \S+\.\z~i, ~^\S+ [gs]etter\.\z~i]`
- `fullOpeningTag`
- `functionNameSpacing`
- `getClassNotation` `onObjects: true`
- `heredocIndentation`
- `importNotation` `function: combined, constant: combined, group: keep`
- `incrementForAddOne`
- `indentation` `chain: nesting`
- `keywordCasing`
- `kindInClassName`
- `lineEnding`
- `magicConstantCasing`
- `multilineArray` `shape: keep, maxWidth: 130`
- `multilineCall`
- `multilineChain` `leadingLinks: sameLine`
- `multilineCondition` `shape: [perLine, compact], operatorPosition: start`
- `multilineSignature` `promotedProperty: always`
- `multilineTernary`
- `nameCasing` `class: PascalCase, method: camelCase, constant: PascalCase, enumCase: PascalCase, function: camelCase, property: camelCase, variable: camelCase`
- `nameNotation` `class: import, globalClass: keep`
- `namedArgumentSpacing`
- `nativeClassCasing`
- `nativeFunctionCasing`
- `neverForThrowingFunction`
- `newArgumentParentheses` `anonymousClass: forbidden, namedClass: forbidden`
- `noAliasFunctions`
- `noAlternativeSyntax`
- `noBacktickOperators`
- `noBom`
- `noCallUserFunc`
- `noClosingTag`
- `noConsecutivePhpdocs`
