`symfony`
=========

Symfony Coding Standards podle sady `@Symfony` z PHP CS Fixeru, zatím bez většiny pravidel o phpDocu, vychází z `perCs`, odsazení 4 mezerami, konec řádku podle souboru, bez limitu délky řádku. Pravidel celkem: 78.

- `arraySpacing`
- `attributeAfterPhpdoc`
- `attributePosition`
- `attributeSpacing`
- [binaryOperatorSpacing |rules/binaryOperatorSpacing] `alignment: none`
- [blankLines |rules/blankLines] `betweenDeclarations: [0, 1], betweenMethods: 1, betweenInterfaceMethods: 1, betweenMembers: keep, beforeDocumentedMember: keep, afterPhpdoc: 0, afterBlockOpeningBrace: keep, before: {"return":[1,null]}, beforeFirstMethod: 0, afterLastMethod: 0, beforeFirstMember: 0, afterLastMember: 0, betweenTraitUses: keep, afterTraitUses: keep`
- [bracesPosition |rules/bracesPosition] `singlelineAnonymousFunction: keep, emptyBody: ownLine, class: nextLine, anonymousClass: sameLine, anonymousFunction: sameLine, controlStructure: sameLine, emptyAnonymousClass: sameLine`
- `castCanonicalType`
- `castSpacing`
- `classDefinitionSpacing` `beforeParenthesis: none`
- `commaSpacing` `alignment: keep`
- `commentSpacing`
- `complexStringVariable`
- `concatSpacing` `spacing: none`
- `constructSpacing` `allowMultilineExpression: true, arrowFunction: single`
- `controlStructureBraces`
- `declareSpacing`
- `elseifKeyword`
- `eofLineEnding`
- `fallThroughComment`
- `fullOpeningTag`
- `functionNameSpacing`
- `importNotation`
- `incrementForAddOne`
- `indentation` `chain: keep, binary: keep`
- `keywordCasing`
- `lineEnding`
- `magicConstantCasing`
- `nameCasing` `class: PascalCase, method: camelCase, constant: UPPER_CASE, enumCase: PascalCase`
- `nameNotation` `globalClass: backslash, globalFunction: backslash, globalConstant: backslash`
- `namedArgumentSpacing`
- `nativeClassCasing`
- `nativeFunctionCasing`
- `newArgumentParentheses` `anonymousClass: forbidden, namedClass: required`
- `noAlternativeSyntax`
- `noBacktickOperators`
- `noBom`
- `noClosingTag`
- `noContinueInSwitch`
- `noEmptyComments`
- `noEmptyPhpdocs`
- `noEmptyStatements`
- `noHashComments`
- `noShortBoolCasts`
- `noTrailingWhitespace`
- `notEqualsNotation`
- `nullableTypeForDefaultNull`
- `objectOperatorSpacing`
- `offsetBracketSpacing`
- `orderedImports` `order: byName, caseSensitive: false`
- `orderedMembers` `order: [traitUse]`
- `parenthesesSpacing`
- `phpdocCanonicalTypes` `arrayNotation: keep`
- `phpdocTrim`
- `referenceSpacing`
- `semicolonSpacing` `after: single, allowOwnLine: true`
- `shortArraySyntax`
- `singleMemberPerDeclaration` `members: [property, trait]`
- `singleMemberPerLine`
- `singleStatementPerLine`
- `spreadOperatorSpacing`
- `stringQuotes`
- `switchCaseColon`
- `switchCaseSpacing`
- `ternaryOperatorSpacing`
- [trailingComma |rules/trailingComma] `array: required, argument: optional, parameter: required, matchArm: required, closureUse: keep`
- `trueFalseNullCasing`
- `typeHintSpacing` `catch: none`
- `unaryOperatorSpacing`
- [unusedImports |rules/unusedImports]
- `uselessAttributeParentheses`
- `uselessBraces`
